# Qwen3.8-27B, community W4A16 quant (compressed-tensors, Marlin kernels on Ampere); needs a
# 24 GB GPU with nothing else on it. Measured on an RTX 3090 (docs/research/vllm_probe_report.md):
# 18.37 GiB weights, 1.33 GiB KV cache (13,010 tokens), ~2 min to healthy.
# - 0.95 of the GPU: 0.93 leaves too little KV cache for one 8,192-token request.
# - Thinking off for every chat and /tokenize render (the template thinks by default).
# - --language-model-only skips the vision tower.
# - --max-num-batched-tokens=1024 bounds echo's prompt-logprob spike (full 248k-vocab logits
#   per prompt token of a chunk, not covered by vLLM's startup memory profile).
JEVEMU_VLLM_MODEL=cyankiwi/Qwen3.8-27B-AWQ-INT4
JEVEMU_VLLM_MODEL_REVISION=6e134bae811fb5adac50ee042ae5f029ac6779aa
JEVEMU_VLLM_MAX_MODEL_LEN=8192
JEVEMU_VLLM_GPU_MEMORY_UTILIZATION=0.95
JEVEMU_VLLM_DEFAULT_CHAT_TEMPLATE_KWARGS='{"enable_thinking":false}'
JEVEMU_VLLM_EXTRA_ARGS='--language-model-only --max-num-seqs=16 --max-num-batched-tokens=1024'
